COMMENT ON TABLE "flytebrygge" IS 'flytende plattform som er forankret til bunn og hvor plasseringen kan avhenge av vind og strømretning

-- Definition --
An artificial structure attached to land bordering a body of water and fixed in position.
-- Description --
It is usually fixed to the waterbody bottom (for example: a mole) but may occasionally be fixed in position (for example: attached to the shore at one end and held between pilings at the other), but floating. Shoreline constructions are normally used for berthing and/or protection.

