@ps {"from":"PresentasjonTekst","path":[{"name":"teksttype","type":"Teksttype","cardinality":"1","valueDomain":{"kind":"codelist","definition":"beskriver hva teksten står til.","asDictionary":"true","codeList":"https://register.geonorge.no/sosi-kodelister/kartdata/teksttype"},"taggedValues":{"SOSI_navn":"TEKSTTYPE"},"@i":0}]}';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "presentasjontekst"."fna" IS 'A complete name that is used to designate the entity as that designation would normally be written by the originating culture on a map or chart.

@ps {"from":"PresentasjonTekst","path":[{"name":"FNA","type":"Integer","cardinality":"1","@i":1}]}';
COMMENT ON COLUMN "presentasjontekst"."scl" IS 'The modulus (denominator) of the nominal scale at which a feature or feature set was collected.

@ps {"from":"PresentasjonTekst","path":[{"name":"SCL","type":"CharacterString","cardinality":"1","@i":2}]}';

